## DO NOT (post-W44-122)

- DO NOT re-attempt admit-DCT64 on codec_wiki-class without first
  closing the text-region SSIM2 deficit. Admit doesn't touch the
  text deficit.
- DO NOT widen the W44-65 mask1x1 threshold to admit more cells
  (the W44-65 default protects 11 screen cells per this chunk).
- DO NOT default-flip `with_dct_suppress_hint` to `Some(false)`
  (per W44-104 DO-NOT, confirmed by this measurement).
- DO NOT spawn a "find_best_64x64_transform cost-model" chunk —
  the cost model is fine; admit shows DCT64 IS picked when allowed.
  The gate is the gate.
- DO NOT cite this as "W44-104 was wrong" — W44-104 was correct on
  its target; this chunk re-verifies the same conclusion on a
  different cell to remove ambiguity.
